OL,3,AGirl, 6, dies after family killed in
OL,4,Asea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,7,Fsea off Shoreham Fort at about 14:40
OL,8,FBST on Tuesday to a report of four
OL,9,Fpeople in difficulty in the water.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
